Rules:
  [J1] Use Repository pattern for data access abstraction.
  [J2] Use Service layer for business logic orchestration.
  [J3] Use DTOs for API contracts, not entities.
  [J4] Use CQRS for write/read model separation when needed.
  [J5] Use Event Sourcing for audit trails and state reconstruction.
  [J6] Use Saga pattern for distributed transactions.
  [J7] Use Circuit Breaker for resilience in microservices.
  [J8] Use Strategy pattern for interchangeable algorithms.

Pros:
  - Maintainable architecture
  - Testable components
  - Clear separation of concerns

Cons:
  - Initial complexity
  - More files/classes
  - Learning curve

Alternatives:
  - Functional programming
  - Actor model

State: +

